## 10. Opportunities and alternatives (summary; details in `leads.json`)

- **Opportunity (recommended, deferred)**: OME-Zarr/NGFF export for interop once clauses are verified [S9, W6-proposed, L1]. **Alternative (bounded)**: QuPath as a companion tool for pathology-style 2D review, exchanging GeoJSON under our pixel-unit/top-left-origin profile [S5, S6, L3]; or embedding napari as the viewer component [L2] if C5 proves too costly — its bug history [S10] shows the hard coordinate problems are known and fixable in the open.
- **Defect class to design out**: implicit coordinate conventions (§3 chain). Nothing in the surveyed ecosystem suggests inventing a new transform algebra; pin the simple one and test it.

